  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Waffle_Maker?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2b/Waffle_Maker.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926020952\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Waffle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Waffle Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"233\" height=\"233\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Waffle Maker</figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Machine</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 114</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1,250,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  4 d</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 44</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 slot(s)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Size: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2×2</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 89</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Waffle Maker</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">production building</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 114. It was added in Spring 2023 update.\n</p><p>It is used to make <a href=\"/wiki/plain-waffles-35744\" title=\"Plain Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">plain waffles</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/berry-waffles-35745\" title=\"Berry Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">berry waffles</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-waffles-35793\" title=\"Chocolate Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">chocolate waffles</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/breakfast-waffles-35811\" title=\"Breakfast Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">breakfast waffles</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The Waffle Maker looks like \n</p><p>The mastered version \n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Building</b></span></h3>\n<p>It costs 1,250,000 <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> and takes 4 days (or 89 <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>) to build the Waffle Maker. It gives players 44 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> when completed.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Products</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/plain-waffles-35744\" title=\"Plain waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Plain waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/berry-waffles-35745\" title=\"Berry waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Berry waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-waffles-35793\" title=\"Chocolate waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/plain-waffles-35744\" title=\"Plain Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Plain Waffles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/berry-waffles-35745\" title=\"Berry Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Berry Waffles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-waffles-35793\" title=\"Chocolate Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Chocolate Waffles</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 114\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 114\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 117\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>25 min\n</td>\n<td>35 min\n</td>\n<td>40 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 21 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 29 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 34 min\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>198<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>604<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>637<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>24<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>72<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>76<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/blueberry-waffles-36311\" title=\"Blueberry waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Blueberry waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"55\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/breakfast-waffles-35811\" title=\"Breakfast waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Breakfast waffles\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/blueberry-waffles-36311\" title=\"Blueberry Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Blueberry Waffles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/breakfast-waffles-35811\" title=\"Breakfast Waffles\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Breakfast Waffles</a></b>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 118\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Level</a> 119\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>42 min\n</td>\n<td>45 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>★★★ 35 min\n</td>\n<td>★★★ 38 min\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>3<span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>669<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>424<span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>51<span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p><i>Main article: <a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a></i>\n</p><p>The Waffle Maker originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 <a href=\"/wiki/diamond-2524\" title=\"Diamond\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">diamonds</a>. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more <span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> than the previous one.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Mastering</b></span></h3>\n<p>A total of 2,180 hours of production is required to <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">master</a> the Waffle Maker:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"3\"><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3c/Waffle_Maker_Mastered.png/revision/latest?cb=20250926021109\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Mastered Waffle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastered Waffle Maker\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><b>★<br>140 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★<br>410 hrs</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>★★★<br>1,630 hrs</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/a/a5/Mastery_I.png/revision/latest?cb=20260602234714\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery I\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"61\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/36/Mastery_II_5.png/revision/latest?cb=20260605002649\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mastery II 5\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"63\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e9/Waffle_Maker_Mastery.png/revision/latest?cb=20240625221505\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Waffle Maker Mastery\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"66\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% <span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b><span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span></span></b>\n</td>\n<td><b>15% faster</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<div></div>\n<p>Mastering the <b>waffle maker</b> is incredibly difficult, and is one of the hardest production buildings to master in the game. This is because all of it's products are made in a short period of time. Considering you need a total of 2,180 hours to fully master it, it can take a very long time.\n</p><p>The best way to master it would to keep it running as often as possible and to produce breakfast waffles as they take the longest amount of time to be made. However, breakfast waffles are unlocked at experience level 119, five levels after unlocking the waffle maker, which can take months to reach after unlocking the waffle maker. Another way to master it would be to purchase as many production slots as possible, as this can help keep the waffle maker running while you are away from the game. \n</p>\n<hr>\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/production-buildings-7699\" title=\"Production Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Production Buildings</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/bakery-3545\" title=\"Bakery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bakery</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bath-kiosk-34840\" title=\"Bath Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Bath Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/bbq-grill-3552\" title=\"BBQ Grill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BBQ Grill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cake-oven-3556\" title=\"Cake Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cake Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candle-maker-16469\" title=\"Candle Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candle Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/candy-machine-3565\" title=\"Candy Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Candy Machine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/coffee-kiosk-3564\" title=\"Coffee Kiosk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Coffee Kiosk</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/cupcake-maker-35636\" title=\"Cupcake Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Cupcake Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/dairy-3547\" title=\"Dairy\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Dairy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/deep-fryer-33952\" title=\"Deep Fryer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Deep Fryer</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/doner-kebab-stand-36894\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doner Kebab Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Doner Kebab Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/donut-maker-34959\" title=\"Donut Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Donut Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/duck-salon-17003\" title=\"Duck Salon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Duck Salon</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/essential-oils-lab-36027\" title=\"Essential Oils Lab\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Essential Oils Lab</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/feed-mill-3546\" title=\"Feed Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Feed Mill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/flower-shop-28398\" title=\"Flower Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Flower Shop</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/fondue-pot-32980\" title=\"Fondue Pot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fondue Pot</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/fudge-shop-35377\" title=\"Fudge Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fudge Shop</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/hat-maker-18338\" title=\"Hat Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hat Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/honey-extractor-15755\" title=\"Honey Extractor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Honey Extractor</a>  • <a href=\"/wiki/hot-dog-stand-19439\" title=\"Hot Dog Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Hot Dog Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/ice-cream-maker-3560\" title=\"Ice Cream Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Ice Cream Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/jam-maker-3561\" title=\"Jam Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jam Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/jeweler-3562\" title=\"Jeweler\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Jeweler</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/juice-press-3559\" title=\"Juice Press\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Juice Press</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/lobster-pool-8477\" title=\"Lobster Pool\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lobster Pool</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/loom-3555\" title=\"Loom\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Loom</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/lure-workbench-5889\" title=\"Lure Workbench\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Lure Workbench</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/milkshake-bar-35971\" title=\"Milkshake Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Milkshake Bar</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/mine-7452\" title=\"Mine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Mine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Net Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/omelet-station-35818\" title=\"Omelet Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Omelet Station</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-kitchen-20183\" title=\"Pasta Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Kitchen</a>  • <a href=\"/wiki/pasta-maker-19438\" title=\"Pasta Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pasta Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/perfumerie-36209\" title=\"Perfumerie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Perfumerie</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/pie-oven-3554\" title=\"Pie Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pie Oven</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/popcorn-pot-3551\" title=\"Popcorn Pot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Popcorn Pot</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/porridge-bar-35893\" title=\"Porridge Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Porridge Bar</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/pottery-studio-35276\" title=\"Pottery Studio\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pottery Studio</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/preservation-station-35177\" title=\"Preservation Station\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Preservation Station</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/salad-bar-8900\" title=\"Salad Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Salad Bar</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/sandwich-bar-9403\" title=\"Sandwich Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sandwich Bar</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/sauce-maker-8894\" title=\"Sauce Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sauce Maker</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/sewing-machine-14242\" title=\"Sewing Machine\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sewing Machine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/smelter-3557\" title=\"Smelter\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smelter</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/smoothie-mixer-11369\" title=\"Smoothie Mixer\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Smoothie Mixer</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/soup-kitchen-8444\" title=\"Soup Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Soup Kitchen</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/stew-pot-35560\" title=\"Stew Pot\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Stew Pot</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/sugar-mill-3550\" title=\"Sugar Mill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sugar Mill</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/sushi-bar-8892\" title=\"Sushi Bar\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Sushi Bar</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/taco-kitchen-24828\" title=\"Taco Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Taco Kitchen</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/tea-stand-24829\" title=\"Tea Stand\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Tea Stand</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/wok-kitchen-32965\" title=\"Wok Kitchen\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wok Kitchen</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/yogurt-maker-35459\" title=\"Yogurt Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Yogurt Maker</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buil