  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Waffle Maker.png|left|233x233px|Waffle Maker]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n |level = 114\n |price = 1,250,000\n |time = 4 d\n |slots = 2\n |xp = 44\n |dia = 89\n |size = 2×2\n}}\nThe '''Waffle Maker''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 114. It was added in Spring 2023 update.\n\nIt is used to make [[Plain Waffles|plain waffles]], [[Berry Waffles|berry waffles]], [[Chocolate Waffles|chocolate waffles]], and [[Breakfast Waffles|breakfast waffles]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Appearance'''===\nThe Waffle Maker looks like \n\nThe mastered version \n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nIt costs 1,250,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 4 days (or 89 {{Infoicon|dia}}) to build the Waffle Maker. It gives players 44 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Products''' ===\n{{Building Products\n|Plain Waffles|114|25m|198/24\n|Berry Waffles|114|35m|604/72\n|Chocolate Waffles|117|40m|637\n|Blueberry Waffles|118|42m|669\n|Breakfast Waffles|119|45m|424\n}}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe Waffle Maker originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\nA total of 2,180 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Waffle Maker:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Waffle Maker Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Waffle Maker]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />140 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />410 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />1,630 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM5XP.png|100px|]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Waffle Maker Mastery.png|100px]]\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''<span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''15% faster'''\n|}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n\n{{Clr}}Mastering the '''waffle maker''' is incredibly difficult, and is one of the hardest production buildings to master in the game. This is because all of it's products are made in a short period of time. Considering you need a total of 2,180 hours to fully master it, it can take a very long time.\n\nThe best way to master it would to keep it running as often as possible and to produce breakfast waffles as they take the longest amount of time to be made. However, breakfast waffles are unlocked at experience level 119, five levels after unlocking the waffle maker, which can take months to reach after unlocking the waffle maker. Another way to master it would be to purchase as many production slots as possible, as this can help keep the waffle maker running while you are away from the game. \n----\n\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Waffeleisen\n|es = Gofrera\n|it = Banchetto dei waffle\n|no = Vaffeljern\n|ru = Вафельница\n}}\n[[pt-br:Máquina de waffles]]\n\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
  "wikitextHash": "29687d4574f98b7674d2f3ca3c2f837087655a18bfaf9f96cf768d0ce2132d21"
}
